flowchart TB
  accTitle: IPv4 mapping、獨立 firewall policy 與 UDP／TCP 服務語意
  accDescr: 專業圖：由左至右依序是 RFC 1918 private IPv4 host、獨立的 NAT 或 NAPT mapping table、獨立的 firewall policy boundary、outside network；表中以一筆 UDP 教學 tuple 分別示意 address-only NAT 與 address-plus-port NAPT，外側欄以 E 標示觀察位置相關的 outside observed address，並註明只有另有證據確定屬 public/global realm 才可另標 public IP address；下半部以分離時間線呈現 UDP datagram 邊界及可能遺失重排，與 TCP connection establishment 後的 reliable in-order byte stream，且不畫速度排名。

  subgraph A["A　IPv4 表示、mapping 與 policy：三層分開看"]
    direction LR
    HOST["RFC 1918 private IPv4 host<br/>10.0.0.8:49152<br/>UDP；destination 不變"]

    subgraph TABLE["NAT／NAPT mapping table（兩個平行案例）"]
      direction TB
      NAT["address-only NAT<br/>10.0.0.8:49152<br/>→ E:49152<br/>UDP；destination 不變"]
      NAPT["address-plus-port NAPT<br/>10.0.0.8:49152<br/>→ E:62000<br/>UDP；destination 不變"]
      BOUND["分層界線<br/>mapping record ≠ policy evidence<br/>mapping ≠ allow<br/>allow ≠ listener exists<br/>下一項仍須獨立判斷 policy"]
    end

    POLICY{"獨立 firewall<br/>policy boundary"}
    DROP["阻擋<br/>policy evidence"]

    subgraph OBS["outside observation 與條件式 evidence"]
      direction TB
      OUTSIDE["outside network<br/>E = outside observed address<br/>外側觀察位址<br/>目的 listener 仍須另證"]
      EBOUND["E 是觀察位置相關的表示<br/>不等於 public IP address、<br/>永久身分或可達保證"]
      PROOF["只有另有證據：registry allocation<br/>＋ global uniqueness<br/>才可另標 public/global realm<br/>仍不保證 route／policy／listener／reachability"]
    end

    HOST -->|"平行案例 1"| NAT
    HOST -->|"平行案例 2"| NAPT
    NAT -->|"形成 mapping record"| BOUND
    NAPT -->|"形成 mapping record"| BOUND
    BOUND ~~~ POLICY
    POLICY -->|"允許"| OUTSIDE
    POLICY ---|"阻擋"| DROP
    OUTSIDE --- EBOUND
    EBOUND -.->|"條件式另證"| PROOF
  end

  subgraph B["B　Transport service semantics：兩條時間線彼此分離，不比較速度"]
    direction LR
    subgraph U["UDP datagram"]
      direction LR
      UIN["送出<br/>D1　D2　D3　D4<br/>datagram boundary 保留"]
      UNET["服務本身可能<br/>loss／reordering"]
      UOUT["可能收到<br/>D1　D3　D2<br/>D4 未出現"]
      ULIMIT["不內建 delivery、duplicate protection<br/>或 ordering 保證<br/>application 仍有 congestion responsibility"]
      UIN --> UNET --> UOUT
      UOUT --- ULIMIT
    end

    subgraph T["TCP byte stream（不連到上方 NAT 例）"]
      direction LR
      TEST["connection establishment"]
      TSEND["應用送出<br/>A｜B"]
      TSTREAM["reliable、in-order<br/>byte stream"]
      TRECV["應用讀到連續 bytes<br/>不保留 message boundary"]
      TLIMIT["connection 可能 failure<br/>不保證 immediate arrival、application processed<br/>或 identity／confidentiality security"]
      TEST --> TSEND --> TSTREAM --> TRECV
      TRECV --- TLIMIT
    end

    UOUT ~~~ TEST
  end

  SCOPE["全圖推論邊界　mapping table 僅為 IPv4／unicast／一筆 UDP tuple 的 Traditional NAT 教學表示　｜　mapping record ≠ policy evidence　｜　mapping ≠ allow　｜　allow ≠ listener exists　｜　TCP 面板不接 NAT　｜　UDP／TCP 只比較 service semantics、不排名速度"]
  A ~~~ B
  B ~~~ SCOPE

  classDef host fill:#E7F0FA,stroke:#244A72,stroke-width:2px,color:#102A43,font-size:18px;
  classDef mapping fill:#FFF1C7,stroke:#7A5710,stroke-width:3px,color:#2F250F,font-size:18px;
  classDef policy fill:#FDE6E2,stroke:#8A3328,stroke-width:3px,color:#351713,font-size:18px;
  classDef outside fill:#E7F3E8,stroke:#35623B,stroke-width:2px,color:#17341B,font-size:18px;
  classDef stopped fill:#F7F7F7,stroke:#4C5661,stroke-width:3px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#20262D,font-size:18px;
  classDef note fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#4C5661,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:4 4,color:#20262D,font-size:18px;
  classDef boundary fill:#FFF9E8,stroke:#111827,stroke-width:3px,color:#111827,font-size:18px;
  classDef udp fill:#E8F0FB,stroke:#315A89,stroke-width:2px,color:#102A43,font-size:18px;
  classDef tcp fill:#F2EAF8,stroke:#65417D,stroke-width:2px,color:#2D1738,font-size:18px;
  classDef scope fill:#FFF9E8,stroke:#111827,stroke-width:3px,color:#111827,font-size:18px;

  class HOST host;
  class NAT,NAPT mapping;
  class BOUND boundary;
  class POLICY policy;
  class OUTSIDE outside;
  class DROP stopped;
  class EBOUND,PROOF note;
  class UIN,UNET,UOUT,ULIMIT udp;
  class TEST,TSEND,TSTREAM,TRECV,TLIMIT tcp;
  class SCOPE scope;

  style A fill:#FAFCFE,stroke:#52677D,stroke-width:2px
  style TABLE fill:#FFFCF2,stroke:#7A5710,stroke-width:2px
  style OBS fill:#FCFCFC,stroke:#4C5661,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:4 4
  style B fill:#FAFCFE,stroke:#52677D,stroke-width:2px
  style U fill:#F5F8FC,stroke:#315A89,stroke-width:2px
  style T fill:#FAF7FC,stroke:#65417D,stroke-width:2px
  linkStyle default stroke:#25364A,stroke-width:2.5px;
  linkStyle 4,16,17,18 stroke-width:0px;
